OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry through the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith variable cloud and some clear
OL,8,Fspells. Chance of the odd fog patch
OL,9,Fpossible, but much less extensive than
OL,10,FMonday morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FIt will stay dry on Tuesday
OL,13,Fwith some bright or hazy sunshine and
OL,14,Fvariable cloud.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FIt
OL,17,Fwill stay dry through the end of the
OL,18,Fweek with bright or sunny spells
OL,19,Fdeveloping. Turning chillier on
OL,20,FThursday and Friday with overnight
OL,21,Ffrost possible.
